Helping athletes with multiple offers navigate NIL and choose the right fit is rewarding.

But helping the under-recruited athlete earn opportunities? That hits home for me personally because I was that athlete. Most of the athletes we work with had zero offers before they got clarity.

At Clutch Culture Sports, we don't rely on opinions. We use a proven, non-opinion-based evaluation system to identify an athlete's true Level of Play and build a recruiting strategy around it.

📈 99% of the athletes we've evaluated through our non-opinion-based system have gone on to receive offers that matched their projected Level of Play.

We don't guarantee offers. We guarantee clarity. 

You'll leave knowing:
✅ Your true Level of Play.
✅ Where you realistically fit.
✅ What's holding you back.
✅ What to improve.
✅ Your next steps.

